  "status": "partial",
  "summary": "The outbound movement law's core is faithfully present: LocalMovementSender diffs per-axis MSG_MOVE_START/STOP transitions, the jump/fall lifecycle (MSG_MOVE_JUMP with the down-positive ballistic tail, MSG_MOVE_FALL_LAND, the walk-off heartbeat), FALLING/FALLING_FAR flags, the 0.5s heartbeat cadence, SET_FACING suppressed during keyboard turns, normalized orientations, and park-on-detach. Inbound: same-map MSG_MOVE_TELEPORT_ACK is applied-then-acked with camera/facing carry, CMSG_MOVE_WORLDPORT_ACK answers SMSG_NEW_WORLD, and SMSG_FORCE_MOVE_ROOT/UNROOT applies, parks the stream, and acks with MOVEFLAG_ROOT. But most of the server-granted movement family and several whole subsystems are missing.",
  "openItems": [
    {
      "id": "item-triage-0e93dbdb",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "SMSG_FORCE_*_SPEED_CHANGE is not handled (SMSG_FORCE_RUN_SPEED_CHANGE is only an enum constant): server speed grants (mounts, sprint, slows) neither apply locally nor get acked, which the server treats as an unacknowledged forced change",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-f51aa4c4",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "Swimming is entirely absent: no swim state/pitch, MSG_MOVE_START_SWIM/STOP_SWIM are never sent, and the SWIMMING flag never joins the outbound stream",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-a6990e89",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "Granted movement modes - water walk, feather/safe fall, hover, levitate - are neither applied nor acked nor echoed back in the outbound flag mask (SMSG_MOVE_WATER_WALK/SMSG_MOVE_FEATHER_FALL/SMSG_MOVE_SET_HOVER unhandled)",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-f14e9eef",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "SMSG_MOVE_KNOCK_BACK is not handled - no knockback arc or ack",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-e045a610",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "A bare self-addressed MSG_MOVE_* from the server (.go forward-style GM move) is not applied to the local mover",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-37b07b95",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "Transport riding is parse-only: the ONTRANSPORT pose tail is decoded but there is no deck-ride state, no boat-local pose streaming, and no ride-through-worldport handling",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-4ad16310",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "CMSG_STANDSTATECHANGE (sit/stand) and CMSG_MOUNTSPECIAL_ANIM are never sent",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    },
    {
      "id": "item-triage-17acbc67",
      "kind": "gap",
      "text": "The drunk system (DRUNKENSTATE screen effect/gait) has no counterpart",
      "source": "triage-2026-08-09/batch-systems-2.json",
      "added": "2026-08-09",
      "resolved": false
    }
